  "limitations": [
    "The reviewer earlier advised on generic Peptone ontology scope. This review is independent of W03’s three candidate bytes and private helper, but does not present the reviewer’s earlier parent decision as an independently re-approved scientific decision. Exact parent acceptance remains separate.",
