    "This native review uses the actual coordinator working-tree source provenance; the separate committed-head audit binds784ee254 explicitly. It does not pretend these paths were already committed at the coordinator base.",
    "Only this private review packet and its isolated fixtures were written. No worker, maintained, I/J, Git/GitHub or session mutation. Fixture trees are excluded from the portable evidence manifest.",
    "The first private native-review draft omitted category boundary_decisions; native validation refused. This successor adds explicit retain decisions without changing scientific assessments, evidence or candidate bytes. The invalid draft/log remain preserved.",
